{"version":1,"content":"<p>幣安周六表示，計劃在下周末前恢復所有剩餘網絡和資產的提現功能。此前，這家全球最大的加密貨幣交易所遭遇了一起網絡入侵事件，導致平台上價值63億美元的資產在上個月被盜；目前，該交易所的運營正逐步恢復正常。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586402.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T09:22:49.129484+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":105,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T09:09:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T09:15:57.907705+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T09:15:57.907705+00:00","content_hash":"bbc36c0d12ed4c2074dddb97cf582c166040f49ffd63c2b16c22ea23b21345e4","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}